            "line": 64,
            "text": "theorem coe_addNSMul {α : Type*} [AddCommGroup α] [LinearOrder α]\n    [IsOrderedAddMonoid α] {a b δ : α} (h : a ≤ b) (hδ : 0 ≤ δ) (n : ℕ) :\n    (addNSMul h δ n : α) = min b (a + n • δ) := by"
